    A["Open your application folder"] --> B["Confirm the project files"]
    B --> C["Run the app and local checks"]
    C --> D["Publish reviewed source changes"]
    D --> E["Record repository, branch, and commit"]
    E --> F["Continue to CAMP metadata"]
