**`campfile.yml` describes your application for platform support and analytics.** It records application identifiers, business ownership, platform, region, repository, and platform-service links.

**Work location — your application repository on your Mac.** Complete this page after preparing and running the app locally.

## 1. Create the file at the application root

For React Native, create `campfile.yml` beside `package.json`. For native Android or iOS, use the application repository root. Review an existing file with its owner before replacing it.

```text
application-root/
├── campfile.yml
├── package.json       # React Native
├── android/           # React Native Android project
└── ios/               # React Native iOS project
```

