## If a value or validation step is missing

| Problem | Next action |
|---|---|
| Mapping/list format is unclear | Confirm the structure accepted by the active CAMP consumer. |
| Bitrise application URL is unavailable | Obtain the CAMP team’s initial-enrollment rule. |
| One environment or identifier differs between platforms | Ask the owner how the accepted schema represents that application. |
