| `appModuleChanged` | `false`, so this placeholder does not select App. |
| `homeModuleChanged` | A bare `return`, without a file comparison. |
| `searchModuleChanged` | A bare `return`, without a file comparison. |
| `profileModuleChanged` | A bare `return`, without a file comparison. |

These bodies contain no Git-diff logic. Before execution, the template owner must provide the comparison base, module-path rules, shared-file behavior, and handling of unavailable history. The source's `set -x` also traces executed commands. Confirm the permitted log output before using tracing in a workflow with protected inputs.

For each run, define flag initialization and fallback behavior. In the supplied pipeline, a module flag of `true` is insufficient to select Home/Search/Profile if `MODULE_APP` contains the nonempty string `false`.

